{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>去台北想食極濃抹茶，這三間店必去！首先有京都過江龍「八十八良葉舍」。必試Midori抹茶拿鐵加配極濃奶霜，茶味極突出。\n</p>\n<p>其次是「After Rain Dessert and Coffee」，每月僅限兩天供應抹茶甜品拼盤。包含千層蛋糕、爆餡冬甩及八女抹茶塔，甜度適中兼帶炒米香。</p>\n<p>最後還可以到「Naka Matcha」參加抹茶品鑑，盲測茶粉兼親手沖泡專屬抹茶。</p>\n<p>為食出走 ｜ 用味蕾探索世界，由地道小食到追求極致的星級餐廳，每一啖都品嚐著每個城市最獨特的風味。哪一道美食令你念念不忘？即刻DM我哋分享你的為食出走經歷！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475124075531121_11745399376af9bb098f4f2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475124075531121_11745399376af9bb098f4f2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：@kaka.y.matcha)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Dfw1u3jPl5h/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IG精選</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%8f%b0%e5%8c%97cafe/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">台北Cafe</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%8f%b0%e5%8c%97%e7%be%8e%e9%a3%9f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">台北美食</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%8a%b9%e8%8c%b6%e6%8e%a7/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">抹茶控</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：@kaka.y.matcha資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Dfw1u3jPl5h/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gotrip IG</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 15 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T14:11:49.040555+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":420,"images":1,"source":"GoTrip","